: false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151162249", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970476824", "personaname": "Chef Fragardee", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ChefFragardee/", "num_games_owned": 960, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 614, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 609, "last_played": 1751911106, "avatar": "882c36d9f00ca3e2d683d2d97ea956a6550df9f0"}, "language": "english", "review": "The only thing better than the incredible gun-play and satisfying rogue-lite mechanics is the astonishingly good soundtrack. I'm also on a ton of pain meds from my knee surgery two hours ago, so this review might be over the top. Still, it's a thumbs up.", "timestamp_created": 1700687291, "timestamp_updated": 1700687291, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151161064", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073230767", "personaname": "Huffman880", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073230767/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 3835, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 657, "last_played": 1765755429, "avatar": "70988f9629ec22df1f1da9ae9bc15846075ca324"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a pretty solid FPS Roguelike. There is definitely a hierarchy of weapons, and Buddybot stands at the top of it.", "timestamp_created": 1700687004, "timestamp_updated": 1700687004, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151160774", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026005221", "personaname": "Javik", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/J4v1k/", "num_games_owned": 720, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 9897, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6447, "last_played": 1787850668, "avatar": "8b829b94c2cba171234f65fbb1313fd2409cfa0d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazingly satisfying, fast-paced gameplay. Many fun secrets to find and quests to complete. It was already very fun in early access but now even more so as it lets you have all the cool toys you had to choose a few from before at once (gadgets). Gearing in a run is very fun and finding the right items for your build feels good. Rogue-lite progression is also very engaging, if a bit fast. Highly recommended, bring a Brobot!", "timestamp_created": 1700686931, "timestamp_updated": 1700686931, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151160463", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121588045", "personaname": "Phyl Swyft", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PhylSwyft/", "num_games_owned": 444, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1340, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1168, "last_played": 1721358843, "avatar": "10ffe79dd000bf285455e3e140b3e2eb3bb2f1d3"}, "language": "english", "review": "good fun", "timestamp_created": 1700686855, "timestamp_updated": 1700686855, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151159622", "author": {"steamid": "76561198822130977", "personaname": "❂︎ ShifiQ SG ❂", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198822130977/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 8425, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4168, "last_played": 1775898572, "avatar": "a627d3c0e9fe310d6ce9538c3594376522acbb00"}, "language": "english", "review": "Been playing since the first days of the EA, I just love it so much! Bring your brobots and have a blast!", "timestamp_created": 1700686647, "timestamp_updated": 1700686647, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151158851", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041873855", "personaname": "Smarba_0", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198041873855/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 6912, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2691, "last_played": 1741995306, "avatar": "24aacb53dedc23ba555bb782cabab2cfc4e3fdf7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I want to start this review off with: RyseUp has been fantastic to the community.\nIgnoring how awesome this game is, I would recommend it just by virtue of their dev team being great and constantly looking out for the community. I'm leaving this review after they made an update following the 1.0 release.\n\nTheir 1.0 release completely reset your progress. You lose everything, and it wasn't optional. This was very frustrating to have to grind through all of the meta-progression again. I play this with my wife, and we both started to get away from playing the game because we felt robbed. We left feedback via the in-game option stating our disappointment with the direction the game took. Turns out the change to revert all your progress was received very poorly. It's barely been a week, and RyseUp released an update and apology for forcing it. It seems small, but it was a frustration shared by many. Knowing RyseUp listens to feedback is more than enough to get me to publish a positive review. As a customer, I feel respected and listened-to.\n\nOh also, there's a game here. It's awesome. Fast paced gun robots shoot stuff to good music. Buy it.", "timestamp_created": 1700686473, "timestamp_updated": 1700686473, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151158735", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046294773", "personaname": "KSGIE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KSGIE/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 4766, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2714, "last_played": 1734294944, "avatar": "caf730988fda2fe3cbceaabde39bb5edac5ce6d7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gunfire reborn, tylko lepszy i dla ludzi zdrowych na ciele i umyśle (nie furry). Pozdrawiam cieplutko..", "timestamp_created": 1700686446, "timestamp_updated": 1733048060, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151158244", "author": {"steamid": "76561198205815452", "personaname": "ɒlɘuyiV ɘqɘꟼ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamc